  "The share of Luxembourg's imports that were telephone sets increased from 0.3% in 2005 to 3.6% in 2025.",
  "The median share over the period 2005 to 2025 was 2.4%.",
  "The peak share occurred in 2015 at 11.4%, which is notably higher than other years.",
  "Between 2019 and 2020, the share dropped sharply from 7.2% to 1.4%.",
